{"id":"en_cat-unleashed-ascension","title":"Cat Unleashed: Ascension","titleEn":"Cat Unleashed: Ascension","description":"In a world overrun by monsters, high school senior Dustin Chaplin is publicly humiliated during his summoning ceremony when his girlfriend falsely accuses him, leading to his expulsion with only a low-grade F-rank Spectre Cat. Fate, however, has other plans: he awakens the Divine Beastmaster System and transforms the Spectre Cat into a mythical Essence Devourer of catastrophic power, one capable of effortlessly suppressing Country-Destroyers. His journey soon surpasses mere strength, as even the legendary Void Devourer bows to him as a guardian beast. Meanwhile, Anya Lyall, hailed by the alliance as the century's greatest prodigy, remains unaware that the \"loser\" she mocked now walks the path of world destruction. Yet Dustin's ambition reaches beyond dominance—his true goal is to ascend to","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/cat-unleashed-ascension/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/cat-unleashed-ascension/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Anime","Weak to Strong","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dibj8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_cat-unleashed-ascension_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dibj8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_cat-unleashed-ascension_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dibj8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_cat-unleashed-ascension_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com